---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="CV" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    I'm a Senior Auditor at Bank of Commerce, where I support audit and business reviews by extracting, cleaning,
    and validating banking data using SQL and Python — turning raw tables into analysis-ready datasets with
    documentation and quality checks. I build Power BI dashboards and recurring MI reports that help stakeholders
    spot anomalies, control gaps, and performance issues. Before this, I worked across healthcare analytics
    (Proview Global), sales/inventory reporting (Scriptmed), and earlier internship roles in valuation advisory and
    banking, giving me a broad base in translating business requirements into data-driven reports. I also
    co-founded Infoseer Consulting, a data analytics and AI consultancy helping Philippine businesses use their
    data to make better decisions — where I lead client relationships and business strategy.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Master in Applied Business Analytics"
      subtitle="2024 to 2026 at University of Asia & the Pacific, Pasig, Philippines"
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="BS in Business Administration, specialized in Business Analytics"
      subtitle="University of Asia & the Pacific, Pasig, Philippines"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement title="Senior Auditor at Bank of Commerce" subtitle="Aug 2025 – Present">
      Support audit and business reviews by extracting, cleaning, and validating banking data using SQL and
      Python; turn raw tables into analysis-ready datasets with documentation and quality checks. Build Power BI
      dashboards and recurring MI reports (KPIs, trends, exception monitoring) to help stakeholders spot anomalies,
      control gaps, and performance issues. Deliver ad-hoc analytics (segmentation, reconciliations, root-cause
      analysis) partnering with audit teams and business units.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement title="Data Analyst at Scriptmed Inc." subtitle="Apr 2025 – Aug 2025">
      Developed automated incentive reports tracking sales performance, commissions, and bonuses. Created stock
      reports analyzing inventory levels, turnover rates, and supply chain trends. Performed data cleansing and
      validation, identifying and correcting anomalies to ensure 100% accuracy in reporting.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement title="Senior Health Management System Specialist at Proview Global Inc." subtitle="Oct 2019 – Jul 2025">
      Developed analytical reports for healthcare clients to support operational and management decision-making.
      Collaborated with account managers to translate business requirements into data-driven reports. Improved
      reporting efficiency by optimizing report generation processes.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement title="Research Assistant at Department of Trade and Industry" subtitle="Aug 2019 – Oct 2019">
      Prepared analytical reports for healthcare clients, reducing decision-making time.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement title="Intern at Aviso Valuation & Advisory Corp" subtitle="2019">
      Designed and deployed real-time Power BI dashboards analyzing financial data of different clients.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement title="Intern at UnionBank of the Philippines" subtitle="2018">
      Delivered customized reports for internal stakeholders and external clients.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Seminars</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>Data Ethics Seminar — hosted by Mr. Dominic Ligot, University of Asia & the Pacific (2025)</li>
    <li>UA&P x Eskwelabs Hackathon — University of Asia & the Pacific (2025)</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-5 columns-2 mx-6">
    <li>SQL</li>
    <li>Python</li>
    <li>Power BI</li>
    <li>Microsoft Cloud Services</li>
    <li>Data Governance</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
